{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-43-1","title":"Isaiah 43:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Lord comforts the church with his promises. 8 He appeals to the people for witness of his omnipotency. 14 He foretells them the destruction of Babylon, 18 and his wonderful deliverance of his people. 22 He reproves the people as inexcusable.</p>\n<p>created. 7,15,21; 44:2,21; Ps 100:3; 102:18; Jer 31:3; 33:24,26; Eph 2:10 Fear. 14; 35:9,10; 41:14; 44:6,22-24; 48:17; 54:4,5; 62:12; 63:16; Ex 15:13 Jer 50:34; Tit 2:14; Re 5:9 I have called. 42:6; 44:5; 45:4; 49:1; Ex 33:17; Ac 27:20,25 thou art mine. Ex 19:5,6; De 32:9; Eze 16:8; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:17; 2Ti 2:19 Heb 8:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-2","title":"Isaiah 43:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>passest. 8:7-10; 11:15,16; Ex 14:29; Jos 3:15-17; Ps 66:10,12; 91:3-5 Am 9:8,9; Mt 7:25-27; Heb 11:29 I will be. 41:10,14; De 31:6-8; Jos 1:5,9; Ps 23:4; 46:4-7; 91:15; Mt 1:23 2Co 12:9,10; 2Ti 4:17,22 when thou walkest. Da 3:25-27; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:2,3; 4:1; Lu 21:12-18; 1Co 3:13-15 Heb 11:33-38; 1Pe 4:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-3","title":"Isaiah 43:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the Holy One. 30:11; 41:14; 45:15,21; 49:26; 60:16; Ho 13:4; Tit 2:10-14 Tit 3:4-6; Jude 1:25 I gave. Ex 10:7; 2Ch 14:9-14; Pr 11:8; 21:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-4","title":"Isaiah 43:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>precious. Ex 19:5,6; De 7:6-8; 14:2; 26:18; 32:9-14; Ps 135:4; Mal 3:17 Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:9 thou hast been. Ge 12:2; Ps 112:9; Joh 5:44; 1Pe 1:7 I Have. Jer 31:3; Ho 11:1; Mal 1:2; Joh 16:27; 17:23,26; Re 3:9 life. or, person.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-5","title":"Isaiah 43:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Fear not. 2; 41:10,14; 44:2; Jer 30:10,11; 46:27,28; Ac 18:9,10 I will. 11:11,12; 27:12,13; 49:12; 60:1-11; 66:19,20; De 30:3; 1Ki 8:46-51 Ps 22:27-31; 106:47; 107:3; Jer 30:18,19; 31:8,9; Eze 36:24-27 Eze 37:21-28; 39:25-29; Mic 2:12; Zec 8:7; Lu 13:29; Joh 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-6","title":"Isaiah 43:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>bring. 18:7; Jer 3:14,18,19; Ho 1:10,11; Ro 9:7,8,25,26; 2Co 6:17,18 Ga 3:26-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-7","title":"Isaiah 43:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>called. 62:2-5; 63:19; Jer 33:16; Ac 11:26; Jas 2:7; Re 3:12 for I. 1; 29:23; Ps 95:6,7; 100:3; Joh 3:3-7; 2Co 5:17; Ga 6:15; Eph 2:10 Tit 3:5-7 for my. 21; 48:11; Ps 50:23; Joh 15:8; Ro 9:23; Eph 1:6,12; 2:4-7; 1Pe 2:9 1Pe 4:11,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-8","title":"Isaiah 43:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>6:9; 42:18-20; 44:18-20; De 29:2-4; Jer 5:21; Eze 12:2; 2Co 4:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-9","title":"Isaiah 43:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>all the. 45:20,21; 48:14; Ps 49:1,2; 50:1; Joe 3:11 who among. 41:21-26; 44:7-9; 46:10; 48:5,6 that they may. 26; Jos 24:15-24; 1Ki 18:21-24,36-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-10","title":"Isaiah 43:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>my witnesses. 12; 44:8; Joh 1:7,8; 15:27; Ac 1:8; 1Co 15:15 and my servant. 42:1; 55:4; Php 2:7; Col 1:7; Re 1:2,5; 3:14 that ye. 40:21,22; 41:20; 45:6; 46:8,9; Joh 20:31 I am he. 41:4; 44:6-8 no God formed. or, nothing formed of God.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-11","title":"Isaiah 43:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>3; 12:2; 45:21,22; De 6:4; Ho 1:7; 13:4; Lu 1:47; 2:11; Joh 10:28-30 Ac 4:12; Tit 2:10,13; 3:4-6; 2Pe 3:18; 1Jo 4:14; 5:20,21; Jude 1:25 Re 1:11,17,18; 7:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-12","title":"Isaiah 43:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>declared. 37:7,35,36; 46:10; 48:4-7 no strange. De 32:12; Ps 81:9,10 my witnesses. 10; 37:20; 44:8; 46:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-13","title":"Isaiah 43:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>before. 57:15; Ps 90:2; 93:2; Pr 8:23; Mic 5:2; Hab 1:12; Joh 1:1,2; 8:58 1Ti 1:17; Heb 13:8; Re 1:8 none. De 28:31; 32:39; Ps 50:22; Ho 2:10; 5:14 I will work. 46:10; Job 9:12; 34:14,15,29; Pr 21:30; Da 4:35; Ro 9:18,19 Eph 1:11 let it. Heb. turn it back. 14:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-14","title":"Isaiah 43:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the Lord. 1; 44:6; 54:5-8; Ps 19:14; Re 5:9 For. 3,4; 44:24-28; 45:1-5; Jer 50:2-11,17,18,27-34; 51:1-11,24,34-37 Re 18:20,21 nobles. Heb. bars. 45:2 whose cry. Eze 27:29-36; Re 18:11-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-15","title":"Isaiah 43:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the Lord. 3; 30:11; 40:25; 41:14,16; 45:11; 48:17; Jer 51:5; Hab 1:12; Re 3:7 the creator. 1,7,21; 33:22; Ps 74:12; Mt 25:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-16","title":"Isaiah 43:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>maketh. 2; 11:15,16; 51:10,15; 63:11-13; Ex 14:16,21,29; Jos 3:13-16 Ne 9:11; Ps 74:13,14; 77:19; 78:13; 106:9; 114:3-5; 136:13-15 Jer 31:35; Re 16:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-17","title":"Isaiah 43:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>bringeth. Ex 14:4-9,23-28; 15:4; Ps 46:8,9; 76:5,6; Eze 38:8-18 they shall. 14:20-22; Re 19:17-21; 20:8-9 they are. 1:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-18","title":"Isaiah 43:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>46:9; 65:17; De 7:18; 8:2; 1Ch 16:12; Jer 16:14,15; 23:7,8; 2Co 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-19","title":"Isaiah 43:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I will do. 42:9; 48:6; Jer 31:22; Re 21:5 I will even. 35:6-10; 40:3,4; 48:21; Lu 3:4,5 rivers. 41:18; 48:21,22; Ex 17:6; Nu 20:11; De 8:15; Ps 78:16-20; 105:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-20","title":"Isaiah 43:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>beast. 11:6-10; Ps 104:21; 148:10 owls. or, ostriches. Heb. daughters of the owl. to give. 19; 41:17; 48:21; 49:10; 55:1,2; Jer 31:9; Joe 3:18; Joh 4:10,14 Joh 7:37-39; Re 21:6; 22:17 my chosen. 65:15; 1Ch 16:13; Ps 33:12; Mr 13:20; 1Pe 2:9; Re 17:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-21","title":"Isaiah 43:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>50:7; 60:21; 61:3; Ps 4:3; 102:18; Pr 16:4; Lu 1:74,75; 1Co 6:19,20 1Co 10:31; Eph 1:5-12; 3:21; Col 1:16; Tit 2:14; Heb 13:15; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-22","title":"Isaiah 43:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>thou hast not. 64:7; Ps 14:4; 79:6; Jer 10:25; Da 9:13; Ho 7:10-14; 14:1,2 Jas 4:2,3 thou hast been. Job 21:14,15; 27:9,10; Jer 2:5,11-13,31,32; Mic 6:3; Mal 1:13 Mal 3:14; Joh 6:66-69</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-23","title":"Isaiah 43:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>hast not. Am 5:25; Mal 1:13,14; 3:8 small cattle. Heb. lambs, or kids. honoured. 1:11-15; 66:3; Pr 15:8; 21:27; Am 5:21,22; Zec 7:5,6; Mt 11:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-24","title":"Isaiah 43:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>no sweet. Ex 30:7,23,24,34; Jer 6:20 neither. Le 3:16; 4:31; Ps 50:9-13 filled me. Heb. made me drunk. or, abundantly moistened.thou hast made. 1:14,24; 7:13; 63:10; Ps 95:10; Eze 6:9; 16:43; Am 2:13; Mal 1:14 Mal 2:13-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-25","title":"Isaiah 43:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>even I. 11; 1:18; 44:22; Ps 51:9; Jer 50:20; Mic 7:18,19; Mr 2:7; Ac 3:19 Ro 5:20 for mine. 37:35; 48:8-10; Ps 25:7,11; 79:9; Eze 20:9,14,22; 36:22,32 Eph 1:6,8 will not. Ps 79:8; Jer 31:34; Heb 8:12; 10:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-26","title":"Isaiah 43:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Put. 1:18; Ge 32:12; Job 16:21; 23:3-6; 40:4,5; Ps 141:2; Jer 2:21-35 Eze 36:37; Ro 11:35 declare. 9; Job 40:7,8; Lu 10:29; 16:15; 18:9-14; Ro 8:33; 10:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-27","title":"Isaiah 43:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>first father. Nu 32:14; Ps 78:8; 106:6,7; Jer 3:25; Eze 16:3; Zec 1:4-6; Mal 3:7 Ac 7:51; Ro 5:12 and thy. 3:12; 28:7; 56:10-12; Jer 5:31; 23:11-15; La 4:13,14; Eze 22:25-28 Ho 4:6; Mic 3:11; Mal 2:4-8; Mt 15:14; 27:1,41; Joh 11:49-53 Ac 5:17,18 teacher. Heb. interpreters.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-43-28","title":"Isaiah 43:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":43,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":43,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>I have. 47:6; 2Sa 1:21; Ps 89:39; La 2:2,6,7; 4:20 princes. or, holy princes. Ps 82:6,7 and have. 42:24,25; 65:15; De 28:15-20; 29:21-28; Ps 79:4; Jer 24:9; Da 9:14 Zec 8:13; Lu 21:21-24; 1Th 2:16</p>"}]}